@crew larsen-hamid
// Writer-commons, batch 3: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}! Larsen, infirmary. Drink some water. That's my whole introduction.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! Did you know most people aboard drink too little water? Most people!
- {hi}! The boat's called the Morning Tide now. Last week it was something else.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}! I'll give you a ride on the boat. First passenger. It's yours.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Saved forty credits for the boat. That's one oar. Nearly.
? mood:low
- Long day. I'll play the guitar tonight. Quietly. For everyone's sake.

== near
? act:work
- Sit up straight. No, straighter. Good. Your back will thank you in twenty years.
? act:leisure
- Music room's free. Tamsin and I are practising. Earplugs are by the door.   #funny

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I'm saving for a boat on the Ostrander colonies. Small. Blue. Named. Renamed.
? tier>=colleague
- I tell everyone to eat breakfast. I skip breakfast. I'm aware. I'm working on it.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Want to hear the boat fund? To the credit? I'll tell you anyway. It's going up.

== about
? aff:haddad-tamsin:friend
- Tamsin's a terrible guitarist. Like me. That's why we get on.   #funny

// Writer-commons, batch 6: towards about 30 own lines.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}! Did you eat breakfast? Me? No. Do as I say, not as I do.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}! Guess how much is in the boat fund. Higher. Higher. Lower. There.
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- There you are! Hydrated, I hope. You look slightly underwatered. Like a plant.   #funny

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- {bye}! Sit up straight on the way out!
? tier>=friend
- See you, {me}. Thanks for listening. I do talk a lot. I know. I'm working on it.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine! Good, actually. Did you know people blink fifteen times a minute? I'm fine.   #funny

== near
? act:work
- Pillow corners, sheet corners, bed corners. Corners are the whole job, really.
? act:meal
- Eat slowly. Your stomach takes twenty minutes to notice. Fact.

== life
? tier>=colleague
- Tamsin and I are the worst guitarists aboard. Together we're nearly one good one.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- The boat. I keep saving. One day I'll leave the Wren for it. Not soon. One day.

== invite
? trad:jam tier>=acquaintance
- Music jam tonight! I'll play. Badly. Come and be supportive. Loudly.

== accept
- Absolutely! Brilliant. I'll be there. I'll bring water. For both of us.
== decline
- Can't tonight, sorry. Guitar practice. The neighbours insist I do it far away.   #funny
== missed
- You didn't come! I had a whole fact ready. I'll save it.   #funny
== birthday
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday! I'm putting all the presents in the boat fund. Kidding. Mostly.   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! Drink some water. That's from me. Also here's a biscuit.   #warm
== hint
- Got a minute? I'll talk less this time. Promise.

// Writer 3, batch 4: bubbles (smalltalk and rumour, 60 characters, said to no one in particular).

== smalltalk
- Water first. Then everything else.
- The boat's got a new name this week. Again.   #funny
- Breakfast is important. I've skipped it.   #funny
- Stretch before the gym. Please.
? act:work
- Sit. Breathe. Tell me where it hurts.

== rumour
- Right, so, I heard a thing. Full details.
- I've a theory. Several, actually.

// Writer 3, batch 5: callbacks (told: said once).

== callback
? told:fav.fetch
- You fetched it! Brilliant. Did you lift with your knees? Tell me you did.   #funny
? told:fav.job
- You did my job! Thank you. I used the time to plan the boat. Full rig.   #funny
? told:fixed.uv
- Steriliser's running clean. Was that you? Good. Clean is everything.
? told:came.jam
- You came to the jam! Tamsin and I were... learning. Thanks for staying.   #funny
? told:gift.music
- Your music's on every evening. I've named the boat after a song. This week.   #funny
? told:bday
- You remembered my birthday! Drink some water to celebrate. I am.   #funny

// Writer 3, batch 6: your standing with their department (rep:, "this band or better") and what you're known for
// (you:), as greet lines (the head writer: the rep and knownFor kinds wait until the game calls them).

== greet
? rep:well tier>=acquaintance
- Infirmary likes you! Your water intake's improved. I've been watching. Kindly.   #funny
? rep:theirs
- You're infirmary family now. That means we nag. Kindly. Mostly about water.   #funny
? you:chatty
- They say you chat to everyone. Brilliant. Good for the heart, talking. Proven.
